{% comment %}
  Renders facets (filtering and sorting)

  Accepts:
  - results: {Object} Collection or Search object
  - enable_filtering: {Boolean} Show filtering when true
  - enable_sorting: {Boolean} Show sorting when true
  - filter_type: {String} Type of filter
  - paginate: {Object}
  - search_facets_only: {Boolean} (optional) Show only the parts finder's filters
    (search_facet_params below), whatever else the store's Search & Discovery has
  - show_search_cta: {Boolean} (optional) Render the design's red "Find My Part" /
      "Search Part" (vehicles) submit button after the last dropdown. Opt-in because
      collection pages render this same snippet and must not get a parts CTA.
  - scope_type: {String} (optional) 'part' or 'vehicle'. Echoed back as a hidden
      input so the scope survives the AJAX re-render that sorting triggers - the
      form otherwise carries only Dawn's type=product and the section loses track
      of which list it is (CLI-652).

  Usage:
  {% render 'facets', results: collection, enable_filtering: true, enable_sorting: true, filter_type: 'vertical', paginate: paginate %}
{% endcomment %}

{%- comment -%} CLI-512: vehicles have no prices — hide price sorts on vehicle results {%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture facets_url_probe -%}{{ content_for_header }}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- liquid
  assign facets_page_url = facets_url_probe | split: '"pageurl":"' | last | split: '"' | first
  assign facets_hide_price_sort = false
  assign facets_search_cta = 'Find My Part'
  comment
    The search page shows only the parts finder's filters: Year, Make, Model and
    Part Type, plus the hidden Type that keeps Parts and Vehicles apart. Shopify's
    Search & Discovery app adds Price and Availability to a new store by default,
    and they turned up as extra dropdowns in the hero (Goldwing).
  endcomment
  assign search_facet_params = 'filter.p.m.custom.year,filter.p.m.custom.make,filter.p.m.custom.model,filter.p.m.custom.part_type,filter.p.m.custom.type' | split: ','
  if facets_page_url contains 'type=VEHICLE' or facets_page_url contains 'type=vehicle'
    assign facets_hide_price_sort = true
    comment
      417: the Vehicles frame (18046-9423) labels this button "Search Part"
    endcomment
    assign facets_search_cta = 'Search Part'
  endif
-%}

{{ 'component-show-more.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{{ 'component-swatch-input.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{{ 'component-swatch.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

{% if results.terms == "vehicle" %}
  {% assign appendurl = "&filter.p.m.custom.type=VEHICLE" %}
  {%elsif results.terms == "PART" %}
  {% assign appendurl = "&filter.p.m.custom.type=PART" %}
{% endif %}

{%- liquid
  assign sort_by = results.sort_by | default: results.default_sort_by
  assign total_active_values = 0
  assign default_presentation = 'text'
  if results.url
    assign results_url = results.url | append: appendurl
  else
    assign terms = results.terms | escape
    assign results_url = '?q=' | append: terms | append: '&options%5Bprefix%5D=last&sort_by=' | append: sort_by | append: appendurl
  endif
-%}

<div class="facets-container{% if filter_type == 'drawer' %} facets-container-drawer{% endif %}{% if settings.animations_reveal_on_scroll %} scroll-trigger animate--fade-in{% endif %}">
  {%- if filter_type == 'vertical' or filter_type == 'horizontal' or filter_type == 'select' -%}
    <facet-filters-form class="facets small-hide">
      <form
        id="FacetFiltersForm"
        class="{% if filter_type == 'horizontal' %}facets__form{% else %}facets__form-vertical{% endif %}"
      >
        {%- if results.terms -%}
          <input type="hidden" name="q" value="{{ results.terms | escape }}">
          <input name="options[prefix]" type="hidden" value="last">
        {%- endif -%}
        <input type="hidden" name="type" value="product">
        {%- comment -%} CLI-652: keeps the Parts/Vehicles scope across a sort. facets.js
          rebuilds the request from this form's inputs, so anything not in here is lost.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- if scope_type != blank -%}
          <input type="hidden" name="scope_type" value="{{ scope_type }}">
        {%- endif -%}

        {% if enable_filtering %}
          {% unless active_value_only %}
          {% comment %} Heading is the first tabbable element on filter type horizontal {% endcomment %}
          <div
            id="FacetsWrapperDesktop"
            {% if filter_type == 'horizontal' %}
              class="facets__wrapper"
            {% endif %}
          >
            {%- if filter_type == 'horizontal' and results.filters != empty -%}
              <h2 class="facets__heading caption-large text-body medium-hide large-up-hide small-hide" id="verticalTitle" tabindex="-1">
                {{ 'products.facets.filter_by_label' | t }}
              </h2>
            {%- endif -%}
            {% comment %} Pills are right below the title for filter type vertical {% endcomment %}
            {%- if filter_type == 'vertical' -%}
              <div class="active-facets active-facets-desktop">
                <div class="active-facets-vertical-filter">
                  {%- unless results.filters == empty -%}
                    <h2
                      class="facets__heading facets__heading--vertical caption-large text-body"
                      id="verticalTitle"
                      tabindex="-1"
                    >
                      {{ 'products.facets.filter_by_label' | t }}
                    </h2>
                  {%- endunless -%}
                  <facet-remove class="active-facets__button-wrapper 2">
                    <a href="{{ results_url }}&type=product" class="active-facets__button-remove underlined-link">
                      <span>{{ 'products.facets.clear_all' | t }}</span>
                    </a>
                  </facet-remove>
                </div>
                {%- for filter in results.filters -%}
                  {%- for value in filter.active_values -%}
                    <facet-remove>
                      <a href="{{ value.url_to_remove }}&type=product" class="active-facets__button active-facets__button--light">
                        <span class="active-facets__button-inner button button--tertiary">
                          {{ filter.label | escape }}: {{ value.label | escape }}
                          <span class="svg-wrapper">
                            {{- 'icon-close-small.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
                          </span>
                          <span class="visually-hidden">{{ 'products.facets.clear_filter' | t }}</span>
                        </span>
                      </a>
                    </facet-remove>
                  {%- endfor -%}
                  {% if filter.type == 'price_range' %}
                    {% assign min = filter.min_value.value %}
                    {% assign max = filter.max_value.value %}
                    {%- if min != null or max != null -%}
                      <facet-remove>
                        <a href="{{ filter.url_to_remove }}&type=product" class="active-facets__button active-facets__button--light">
                          <span class="active-facets__button-inner button button--tertiary">
                            {{ min | default: 0 | money }} - {{ max | default: filter.range_max | money }}
                            <span class="svg-wrapper">
                              {{- 'icon-close-small.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
                            </span>
                            <span class="visually-hidden">{{ 'products.facets.clear_filter' | t }}</span>
                          </span>
                        </a>
                      </facet-remove>
                    {%- endif -%}
                  {% endif %}
                {%- endfor -%}
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}

            <script src="{{ 'show-more.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>
            {% comment %} Filters for both horizontal and vertical filter {% endcomment %}
            {%- for filter in results.filters -%}
              {%- if search_facets_only -%}{%- unless search_facet_params contains filter.param_name -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endunless -%}{%- endif -%}
              {% liquid
                assign total_active_values = total_active_values | plus: filter.active_values.size
                assign presentation = filter.presentation | default: default_presentation

                if presentation == 'image'
                  assign show_more_number = 12
                  assign visual_layout_class = 'facets-layout facets-layout-grid facets-layout-grid--' | append: presentation
                else
                  assign show_more_number = 10
                  assign visual_layout_class = 'facets-layout facets-layout-list facets-layout-list--' | append: presentation
                endif
              %}

              {% case filter.type %}
                {% when 'boolean', 'list' %}
                    {% assign filter_label = filter.label | handle %}
                    {% comment %} {% if filter_label == 'type' %}{% continue %}{% endif %} {% endcomment %}
                    {%- liquid
                      comment
                        417: Year, Make, Model, Part Type always sit in that order (Figma
                        18046-6481), whether a dropdown is real or the placeholder below.
                      endcomment
                      assign facet_order = 9
                      case filter.param_name
                        when 'filter.p.m.custom.year'
                          assign facet_order = 1
                        when 'filter.p.m.custom.make'
                          assign facet_order = 2
                        when 'filter.p.m.custom.model'
                          assign facet_order = 3
                        when 'filter.p.m.custom.part_type'
                          assign facet_order = 4
                      endcase
                    -%}
                    <details
                      style="order: {{ facet_order }};"
                      id="Details-{{ filter.param_name | escape }}-{{ section.id }}"
                      class="{% if filter_type == 'horizontal' %}disclosure-has-popup facets__disclosure{% else %} facets__disclosure-vertical{% endif %} js-filter {% if filter_label == 'part-variant-description' %}disable{% endif %} details-for-hide-{{filter_label}} {% if search.terms == 'car' %}details-{{filter_label}}{% endif %}"
                      data-index="{{ forloop.index }}"
                      data-type="{{ filter.label | handle }}"
                      {% if filter_type == 'vertical' and forloop.index == 1 %}
                        open
                      {% endif %}
                    >
                      <summary
                        class="facets__summary caption-large focus-offset"
                        aria-label="{{ filter.label | escape }} ({{ 'products.facets.filters_selected.one' | t: count: filter.active_values.size }})"
                      >
                        <div>
                          <span class="facets__summary-label">
                            {%- if filter_type == 'horizontal' -%}
                              {% if filter.active_values.size > 0 %}
                                {% assign max_visible = 2 %}
                                {% assign total = filter.active_values.size %}
                                {% assign remaining = total | minus: max_visible %}
                                {% assign max_visible_last = max_visible | minus: 1 %}

                                {% for value in filter.active_values %}
                                  {% if forloop.index0 < max_visible %}
                                    {{ value.label }}{% unless forloop.last or forloop.index0 == max_visible_last %} - {% endunless %}
                                  {% endif %}
                                {% endfor %}

                                {% if remaining > 0 %}
                                  (+{{ remaining }})
                                {% endif %}
                              {% else %}
                                {{ filter.label | escape }}
                              {% endif %}
                            {% else %}
                              {{ filter.label | escape }}
                              {%- if filter_type == 'vertical' -%}
                                <span class="facets__selected{% if filter.active_values.size == 0 %} hidden{% endif %}">
                                  ({{ filter.active_values.size }})</span
                                >
                              {%- endif -%}
                            {%- endif -%}
                          </span>
                          {%- if filter_type == 'vertical' and filter.operator == 'AND' -%}
                            <span class="facets__and-helptext">
                              {{ 'products.facets.filter_and_operator_subtitle' | t }}
                            </span>
                          {%- endif -%}
                          {{ 'icon-down-arrow.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
                        </div>
                      </summary>
                      <div
                        id="Facet-{{ forloop.index }}-{{ section.id }}"
                        class="parent-display {% if filter_type == 'horizontal' %}facets__display{% else %}facets__display-vertical{% endif %}"
                      >
                        {%- if filter_type != 'vertical' -%}
                          <div class="facets__header">
                            <div>
                              <span class="facets__selected">
                                {{- 'products.facets.filters_selected' | t: count: filter.active_values.size -}}
                              </span>
                              {%- if filter.operator == 'AND' -%}
                                <span class="facets__and-helptext">
                                  {{ 'products.facets.filter_and_operator_subtitle' | t }}
                                </span>
                              {%- endif -%}
                            </div>
                            <facet-remove>
                              <a href="{{ filter.url_to_remove }}" class="facets__reset link underlined-link">
                                {{ 'products.facets.reset' | t }}
                              </a>
                            </facet-remove>
                          </div>
                        {%- endif -%}
                        <fieldset class="facets-wrap parent-wrap {% if filter_type == 'vertical' %} facets-wrap-vertical{% endif %}">
                          <legend class="visually-hidden">{{ filter.label | escape }}</legend>
                          {%- liquid
                            assign sorted_values = filter.values
                            # Keep the selected values grouped together when operator is AND
                            if filter.operator == 'AND'
                              assign active_filter_values = filter.values | where: 'active', true
                              assign inactive_filter_values = filter.values | where: 'active', false
                              assign sorted_values = active_filter_values | concat: inactive_filter_values
                            endif
                          -%}
                          <ul
                            class="{{ visual_layout_class }}{% if filter_type == 'vertical' %} facets__list--vertical{% else %} facets__list{% endif %} list-unstyled"
                            role="list"
                          >
                            <div class="filter-search-container 1">
                              <input type="text" class="filter-search-bar" placeholder="Search filters..." />
                            </div>
                            {%- for value in sorted_values -%}
                              {% liquid
                                assign input_id = 'Filter-' | append: filter.param_name | escape | append: '-' | append: forloop.index
                                assign is_disabled = false
                                if value.count == 0 and value.active == false
                                  assign is_disabled = true
                                endif

                                # Spares Plus (CLI-688): custom.type is an
                                # internal routing enum, so the Type facet was
                                # offering customers "PART" and "VEHICLE" in
                                # raw caps. Only these two exact values are
                                # rewritten - a blanket `capitalize` would turn
                                # make names like BMW into "Bmw". The active
                                # filter chips already skip them (lines 411,
                                # 424, 898); this is the list they were missed in.
                                assign value_display = value.label
                                if value_display == 'PART'
                                  assign value_display = 'Part'
                                elsif value_display == 'VEHICLE'
                                  assign value_display = 'Vehicle'
                                endif
                              %}
                              {%- capture label_class -%}
                              facets__label facet-checkbox{% if is_disabled %} disabled{% endif %}{% if value.active %} active{% endif %}
                              {%- endcapture -%}
  
                              {%- capture text_value -%}
                                <span class="facet-checkbox__text" aria-hidden="true">
                                  <span class="facet-checkbox__text-label">{{- value_display | escape }}</span> ({{- value.count -}})
                                </span>
                                <span class="visually-hidden">
                                  {{- value_display | escape }} (
                                  {%- if value.count == 1 -%}
                                    {{- 'products.facets.product_count_simple.one' | t: count: value.count -}}
                                  {%- else -%}
                                    {{- 'products.facets.product_count_simple.other' | t: count: value.count -}}
                                  {%- endif -%}
                                  )
                                </span>
                              {%- endcapture -%}
  
                              <li class="list-menu__item facets__item{% if forloop.index > show_more_number and filter_type == 'vertical' %} show-more-item hidden{% endif %}">
                                {% if filter.label == 'Select Make' %}
                                  {%- comment -%} CLI-511/571: makes without an uploaded logo used to
                                    render a bare 39px spacer instead of an image, so the list mixed
                                    plain rows with logo rows and appeared to flicker as it
                                    re-rendered. Every row now carries an image slot, falling back to
                                    a generic mark that ships with the theme. {%- endcomment -%}
                                  {% assign value_make = value.label %}
                                  {% assign image_url = value_make | handle | append: '.png' | file_img_url: '30x30' %}
                                  {% assign common_url = 'common.png' | file_img_url: '30x30' %}{% comment %} 417: the store's uploaded generic make image {% endcomment %}
                                  {% unless image_url contains "?v=" %}
                                    {% assign image_url = common_url %}
                                  {% endunless %}
                                  <img class="value_name_filter_image" src="{{ image_url }}" alt="{{ value.label | handle }}" width="30" height="30" loading="lazy" onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='{{ common_url }}'">
                                {% endif %}

                                {% assign param_name = filter.param_name | split: '.' | last %}

                                {%- if presentation == 'swatch' -%}
                                  <div class="{{ label_class }}">
                                    <div class="swatch-input-wrapper">
                                      {% render 'swatch-input',
                                        id: input_id,
                                        type: 'checkbox',
                                        name: value.param_name,
                                        value: value.value,
                                        product_form_id: 'FacetFiltersForm',
                                        swatch: value.swatch,
                                        checked: value.active,
                                        disabled: is_disabled,
                                        data_type: true,
                                        param_name: param_name
                                      %}
                                    </div>
  
                                    {{ text_value }}
                                  </div>
                                {%- else -%}
                                  <label for="{{ input_id }}" class="{{ label_class }}">
                                    <input
                                      type="checkbox"
                                      name="{{ value.param_name }}"
                                      value="{{ value.value }}"
                                      id="{{ input_id }}"
                                      data-type="{{ param_name }}"
                                      {% if value.active %}
                                        checked
                                      {% endif %}
                                      {% if is_disabled %}
                                        disabled
                                      {% endif %}
                                    >
  
                                    {%- if presentation == 'image' -%}
                                      <div class="facets__image-wrapper">
                                        {%- if value.image -%}
                                          {{
                                            value.image
                                            | image_url: width: 300
                                            | image_tag: class: 'facets__image', alt: value.alt
                                          }}
                                        {%- endif -%}
                                      </div>
                                    {%- else -%}
                                      {{- 'icon-checkbox.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
  
                                      <div class="svg-wrapper">
                                        {{- 'icon-checkbox-mark.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
                                      </div>
                                    {%- endif -%}
  
                                    {{ text_value }}
                                  </label>
                                {%- endif -%}
                              </li>
                            {%- endfor -%}
                          </ul>
                        </fieldset>
                        {%- if filter.values.size > show_more_number and filter_type == 'vertical' -%}
                          <show-more-button>
                            <button
                              class="button-show-more link underlined-link"
                              id="Show-More-{{ forloop.index }}-{{ section.id }}"
                              type="button"
                            >
                              <span class="label-show-more label-text"
                                ><span aria-hidden="true">+ </span>{{ 'products.facets.show_more' | t -}}
                              </span>
                              <span class="label-show-less label-text hidden"
                                ><span aria-hidden="true">- </span>{{ 'products.facets.show_less' | t -}}
                              </span>
                            </button>
                          </show-more-button>
                        {%- endif %}
                      </div>
                    </details>

                {% when 'price_range' %}
                  <details
                    id="Details-{{ filter.param_name | escape }}-{{ section.id }}"
                    class="{% if filter_type == 'horizontal' %}disclosure-has-popup facets__disclosure{% else %} facets__disclosure-vertical{% endif %} js-filter"
                    data-index="{{ forloop.index }}"
                    {% if filter_type == 'vertical' and forloop.index == 1 %}
                      open
                    {% endif %}
                  >
                    <summary class="facets__summary caption-large focus-offset">
                      <div>
                        <span>{{ filter.label | escape }}</span>
                        {{- 'icon-caret.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
                      </div>
                    </summary>
                    <div
                      id="Facet-{{ forloop.index }}-{{ section.id }}"
                      class="{% if filter_type == 'horizontal' %}facets__display{% else %}facets__display-vertical{% endif %}"
                    >
                      <div class="{% if filter_type == 'horizontal' %}facets__header{% else %}facets__header-vertical{% endif %}">
                        {%- assign max_price_amount = filter.range_max | money | strip_html | escape -%}
                        <span class="facets__selected">
                          {{- 'products.facets.max_price' | t: price: max_price_amount -}}
                        </span>
                        {%- if filter_type != 'vertical' -%}
                          <facet-remove>
                            <a href="{{ filter.url_to_remove }}" class="facets__reset link underlined-link">
                              {{ 'products.facets.reset' | t }}
                            </a>
                          </facet-remove>
                        {%- endif -%}
                      </div>
                      <price-range class="facets__price">
                        {% render 'price-facet', filter: filter, id_prefix: 'Filter-', filter_type: filter_type %}
                      </price-range>
                    </div>
                  </details>
              {% endcase %}
            {%- endfor -%}

            {%- comment -%}
              417 (Figma 18046-6481 / 18046-9423): the hero always shows Year, Make, Model
              (and Part Type on Parts). Shopify only returns a filter when at least one
              product in the results has a value for it, so with a small catalogue whole
              dropdowns vanished. Any expected filter Shopify didn't return gets a
              look-alike placeholder that can't be opened. It carries no js-filter class,
              so facets.js ignores it.
            {%- endcomment -%}
            {%- if show_search_cta and filter_type == 'horizontal' -%}
              {%- liquid
                assign expected_facets = 'filter.p.m.custom.year|Select Year|1,filter.p.m.custom.make|Select Make|2,filter.p.m.custom.model|Select Model|3,filter.p.m.custom.part_type|Select Part Type|4' | split: ','
                assign present_params = results.filters | map: 'param_name' | join: ','
              -%}
              {%- for expected in expected_facets -%}
                {%- assign expected_parts = expected | split: '|' -%}
                {%- if scope_type == 'vehicle' and expected_parts[0] == 'filter.p.m.custom.part_type' -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
                {%- if present_params contains expected_parts[0] -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
                <details
                  class="disclosure-has-popup facets__disclosure facets__disclosure--placeholder"
                  style="order: {{ expected_parts[2] }};"
                  aria-disabled="true"
                  ontoggle="this.open && this.removeAttribute('open')"
                >
                  <summary class="facets__summary caption-large focus-offset" tabindex="-1" aria-label="{{ expected_parts[1] | escape }} (no options yet)">
                    <div>
                      <span class="facets__summary-label">{{ expected_parts[1] }}</span>
                      {{- 'icon-down-arrow.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
                    </div>
                  </summary>
                </details>
              {%- endfor -%}
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
        {% endunless %}
          {% comment %} Pills after filtes on filter type horizontal {% endcomment %}
          {% if active_value_only %}
          {%- if filter_type == 'horizontal' -%}
            {% assign active_values = false %}
            {% for filter in results.filters %}
              {% for value in filter.active_values %}
                {% unless value.label == 'PART' or value.label == 'VEHICLE' %}
                  {% assign active_values = true %}
                  {% break %}
                {% endunless %}
              {% endfor %}
              {% if active_values %}
                {% break %}
              {% endif %}
            {% endfor %}

            <div class="active-facets active-facets-desktop ">
              {%- for filter in results.filters -%}
                {%- for value in filter.active_values -%}
                  {% if value.label == 'PART' or value.label == 'VEHICLE' %}{% continue %}{% endif %}
                  <facet-remove class="active-filter-remove">
                    <a href="{{ value.url_to_remove }}" class="active-facets__button active-facets__button--light">
                      <span class="active-facets__button-inner button button--tertiary">
                        {{ filter.label | escape }}: {{ value.label | escape }}
                        <span class="svg-wrapper">
                          {{- 'icon-close-small.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
                        </span>
                        <span class="visually-hidden">{{ 'products.facets.clear_filter' | t }}</span>
                      </span>
                    </a>
                  </facet-remove>
                {%- endfor -%}
                {% if filter.type == 'price_range' %}
                  {% assign min = filter.min_value.value %}
                  {% assign max = filter.max_value.value %}
                  {%- if min != null or max != null -%}
                    <facet-remove>
                      <a href="{{ filter.url_to_remove }}" class="active-facets__button active-facets__button--light">
                        <span class="active-facets__button-inner button button--tertiary">
                          {{ min | default: 0 | money }} - {{ max | default: filter.range_max | money }}
                          <span class="svg-wrapper">
                            {{- 'icon-close-small.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
                          </span>
                          <span class="visually-hidden">{{ 'products.facets.clear_filter' | t }}</span>
                        </span>
                      </a>
                    </facet-remove>
                  {%- endif -%}
                {% endif %}
              {%- endfor -%}
              <facet-remove class="active-facets__button-wrapper">
                <a href="{{ results_url }}" class="active-facets__button-remove underlined-link">
                  <span>{{ 'products.facets.clear_all' | t }}</span>
                </a>
              </facet-remove>
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}
        {% endif %}
        {% endif %}


        {% if results.current_vendor or results.current_type %}
          <input type="hidden" name="q" value="{{ results.current_vendor }}{{ results.current_type }}">
        {% endif %}

        {%- comment -%} Spares Plus (CLI-666): the design's red submit button, which
          had never been built - "Find My Part" appeared nowhere in the theme.

          A plain type="submit" is deliberate. facets.js binds only `input` (debounced
          800ms) and never `submit`, so this falls through to a native GET on the
          form. The form's named inputs are exactly q, options[prefix], type and the
          checked facet checkboxes, so the browser builds the same filter URL the
          AJAX path would - it just does a full navigation instead. That keeps the
          button working with JS disabled and makes it deterministic rather than
          racing the 800ms debounce.

          Rendered only when the caller opts in: main-collection-product-grid.liquid
          renders this same snippet and must not sprout a "Find My Part" button.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- if show_search_cta -%}
